inistrators and operators</dd>\n<dt>Version</dt><dd>4.2.1</dd>\n<dt>Last Updated</dt><dd>2025-06-10</dd>\n<dt>Maintainer</dt><dd>Atlas Documentation Team</dd>\n</dl>\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Value</th><th>Unit</th><th>Notes</th><th>Source</th><th>Updated</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>Core Count</td><td>16</td><td>count</td><td>Baseline</td><td>Inventory</td><td>2025-05-01</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Memory</td><td>64</td><td>GB</td><td>DDR5</td><td>Inventory</td><td>2025-05-01</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Storage</td><td>2048</td><td>GB</td><td>NVMe</td><td>Inventory</td><td>2025-05-01</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Network</td><td>10</td><td>Gbps</td><td>Dual</td><td>Inventory</td><td>2025-05-01</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Power</td><td>800</td><td>W</td><td>Redundant</td><td>Inventory</td><td>2025-05-01</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Cooling</td><td>Active</td><td>type</td><td>Liquid</td><td>Inventory</td><td>2025-05-01</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<pre>atlasctl init --config /etc/atlas/config.yaml --force</pre>\n<div class=\"actions\">\n<button data-action=\"run\">Run Command</button>\n<button class=\"secondary\" data-action=\"copy\">Copy</button>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"s002\">\n<h2>2. System Requirements</h2>\n<p>Before deploying Atlas, verify that the target environment meets the minimum hardware and software specifications outlined in this section. Failure to comply may result in degraded performance or service interruption.</p>\n<p>Requirements are categorized by deployment scale: small, medium, and large. Select the appropriate tier based on expected load and redundancy needs.</p>\n<dl>\n<dt>Min CPU</dt><dd>4 cores</dd>\n<dt>Min RAM</dt><dd>16 GB</dd>\n<dt>Disk</dt><dd>500 GB SSD</dd>\n<dt>OS</dt><dd>Linux kernel 5.4+</dd>\n</dl>\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th>Component</th><th>Minimum</th><th>Recommended</th><th>Notes</th><th>Vendor</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>CPU</td><td>Intel Xeon E5</td><td>AMD EPYC 7543</td><td>AVX2 support</td><td>Intel/AMD</td><td>Required</td></tr>\n<tr><td>RAM</td><",
